thus $5x+ \frac {5}{x}+4x- \frac {4}{x}=m$,  
which simplifies to $9x+ \frac {1}{x}=m$;  
since $9x+ \frac {1}{x}\geqslant 6$;  
thus, when $m < 6$, the equation $9x+ \frac {1}{x}=m$ has no solution;  
when $m=6$, the equation $9x+ \frac {1}{x}=m$ has exactly one solution;  
